[00:15.86] On this day we were miles away, we saw a clock up in the sky
[00:22.88] The hands lay on the show to pay, number fallen on its side
[00:31.42] This day
[00:34.96] Just one note that was all she wrote and the sound blew down the walls
[00:48.20] The one boat that was set to float took a trip right down the falls
[00:56.20] In two ways we could cut the haze and we never used a knife
[01:36.78] In those days there was zero waste, now the waste of time is life
